menu "Gateway"

    config GW_DEFAULT_CHANNEL
        int "ESP-NOW channel when no router is configured"
        range 1 13
        default 1
        help
            Once connected to a router, the gateway follows the router's channel
            and nodes find it by scanning.

    config GW_PROV_AP_PASSWORD
        string "Provisioning SoftAP password (8-63 chars, empty = random each time)"
        default "a12345678"

    config GW_MAX_NODES
        int "Maximum number of paired nodes"
        range 1 14
        default 14
        help
            Limited by ESP_WIFI_ESPNOW_MAX_ENCRYPT_NUM; encrypted ESP-NOW peers and
            SoftAP clients share 17 hardware keys (3 are kept for provisioning).

endmenu
